<title>RUSSIA: Rouble lower at 5,399 per dlr in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble lower at 5,399 per dlr in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble edged down to 5,399 to the dollar on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange (MICEX) from 5,397 on Monday.</p>
<p>				    Sept 24		 Sept 23</p>
<p> Dollar rate		    5,399		   5,397</p>
<p> Volume traded (million $)	6.63		    5.48</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
